Call Lightning beseeches the deities to direct a bolt of lightning from
the heavens to strike your enemies. This powerful prayer can deal
devastating electrical damage to a single target.

To invoke this prayer, you must be outdoors during a rainstorm or
lightning storm. Without stormy skies overhead, there is no lightning
to call down. When conditions are favorable, the destruction wrought
upon your enemies can be spectacular.

A critical success doubles the damage, while the victim may sometimes
partially avoid the strike and take reduced damage. On a critical failure,
the cleric may accidentally call the lightning down upon themselves.

Victims struck by the bolt may also suffer additional effects from the
electrical energy coursing through their bodies.

